<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Jan real PPI +1.4 mo/mo, +4.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Jan real PPI +1.4 mo/mo, +4.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices were 1.4 percent higher in January, putting prices 4.5 percent higher than in the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Thursday.</p>
<p> CZECH PRODCUER PRICES   JAN 1997    DEC 1996    JAN 1996</p>
<p>Industrial</p>
<p>  pct change month/month   +1.4	  +0.0	  +1.3</p>
<p>  pct change year/year     +4.5	  +4.4	  +6.3</p>
<p>Construction prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month   +1.2	  +0.6	  +2.2</p>
<p>  pct change year/year    +10.1	 +11.2	 +12.0</p>
<p>Agricultural prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month    n/a	   n/a	   n/a</p>
<p>  pct change year/year     +5.4	  +6.8	  +2.1</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
